{"id":"663979","name":"荠菜煮鸡蛋","author":"zhangaiwen","authorId":"9213624","desc":"","cover":"images/663979/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"荠菜","amount":"一把"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"若干"}],"sub":[{"name":"生姜","amount":"3片"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"4-5个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"将菜摘洗干净，鸡蛋红枣也用清水洗净。","img":"images/663979/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"备好生姜枸杞。","img":"images/663979/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"冷水下锅。","img":"images/663979/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煮至沸腾，敲碎鸡蛋壳，方便入味。","img":"images/663979/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"再加入适量食盐。","img":"images/663979/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"小火煮15分钟，关火焖个30分钟。","img":"images/663979/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"入味后即可食用，佐以红枣，汤清香甘甜，鸡蛋清甜微咸。","img":"images/663979/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}